OL,3,GNEWSATwo farm workers fall in
OL,4,Aindustrial tank
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have fallen into an
OL,7,Findustrial-sized tank at a farm in
OL,8,FCheshire, launching a rescue operation.
OL,10,FThe men, who were both working on the
OL,11,Ffarm in Aston by Budworth, near
OL,12,FNorthwich, fell into the tank at about
OL,13,F12:20 BST on Wednesday, Cheshire Police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FFirefighters and paramedics also
OL,17,Fattended the farm on Cann Lane, and
OL,18,Frescue work was ongoing, the force
OL,19,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
